Original version: triggers from enemy projectile damage through player_damage_event and applies the listed reflect ratio, cooldown, range, and boss modifier. Browser version: classification = fallback_trigger. Implementation owner = player_damage_event. Authoritative effect values = reflect ratio, cooldown, range, and boss modifier match desktop. Browser cap/fallback = normal browser route disables enemy projectiles, so default route triggers from shield damage by ranged-type enemies; `enemyshots=1` tests the true projectile path. Player copy = card + tooltip because the trigger changes. QA proof = fallback_trigger_count on default route and projectile trigger count with `?enemyshots=1`.

