22.2. Migration rules
v1 -> v2:
Normalize coupon discount field to coupon_level.
Normalize magnet radius to coin_magnet_radius in pixels.

v2 -> v3:
Seed missing keys with default 0/false values.
Clamp all levels to documented max levels.
Remove deprecated transient runtime keys if present.
Browser migration rule:
After any migration, immediately write the migrated payload back through the browser save path so localStorage no longer contains stale prop keys.
Browser migration must clamp prop levels before shop/card rendering because malformed values can overflow small browser cards.

22.3. Corruption handling
If a level has an invalid type or is out of range, coerce it to the nearest valid value and log a migration warning.
If a prop id is unknown, store the raw data in orphan_props for debugging and skip runtime use.

